                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of change into a stony or calcareous substance by the deposition of lime salt; normally, as in the formation of bone and of teeth; abnormally, as in the calcareous degeneration of tissue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
